      "widgets_values": [
        "A basic workflow for the Hildegard Refiner.\n\nTile Sizes: 1024×1024 up to 2560×2560\n\ntile_latent (freedom): Controls how much creative latitude the model has to reinvent details. Values between 0.85–1.00 are the safe range.\n\nSteps: 4–12. Use higher values for greater refinement and sharpness on fine details. \n\nOtherwise the inference pipeline is your playground add a color anchor or even per tile prompting."
      ],
